  "description": "Telemetry for the DotNetCore.Lutter resilience kernel. Turns the hooks the kernel already publishes - circuit-breaker state changes, per-strategy callbacks and the custom-strategy extension point - into .NET metrics and activities, so a host can observe its compositions without the kernel depending on telemetry. No OpenTelemetry dependency. References Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions only.",
